                "string_index": 2,
                "utterance": 0,
                "control": "FFEE",
                "operand": 21,
                "pages": [
                  [
                    "『敵軍似乎是負責鎮守這一帶",
                    "　的空域，以防止他人侵入．",
                    "　看來在惡魔之山一定有什麼",
                    "　事發生，大家要有心理準備",
                    "　，準備面對非常的狀況．』"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "script": "ch24.json",
          "scene": "高度驟降,眾人驚慌",
          "scene_index": 1,
          "lines": [
            {
              "line": 0,
              "upper": false,
              "native_dialogue": {
                "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
                "string_index": 2,
                "utterance": 1,
                "control": "FFEE",
                "operand": 24,
                "pages": [
                  [
                    "『約拿老頭，我們的高度好像",
                    "　開始下降了耶！』"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "line": 1,
              "upper": false,
              "native_dialogue": {
                "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
                "string_index": 2,
                "utterance": 2,
                "control": "FFEE",
                "operand": 20,
                "pages": [
                  [
                    "『的確，而且越來越快了．．",
                    "　』"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "0x24cad#3": {
      "script": "ch24.json",
      "scene_index": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 0,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 8,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『哇啊啊啊！索爾，我好怕！",
                "　』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 1,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『希莉亞，抓緊我！悠妮，妳",
                "　也過來！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 2,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 9,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『．好！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 3,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 5,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『．．．！啊，亞雷斯，",
                "　我頭好昏，．．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 4,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 4,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『不要緊吧？來，抓緊我！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 5,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 5,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『謝謝．，亞雷斯，你真好．",
                "　．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 8,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 6,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 24,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『約拿老頭啊，我就說嘛，現",
                "　在的女孩子要比以前大膽多",
                "　了，連現在這種狀況都可以"
              ],
              [
                "　拿來作調情的機會，看來我",
                "　們都落伍嘍！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
            "string_index": 3,
            "utterance": 7,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 21,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『希爾法，如果你不想被她們",
                "　一腳端下這飛行岩的話，我",
                "　建議你在我們著陸前最好保"
              ],
              [
                "　持安靜．．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
